; Harvester5Pip -- AGGRESSIVE SCALPING preset
; Attach to EUR/USD, timeframe M5.
;
; WHAT IS DIFFERENT FROM THE REQUESTED VALUES, AND WHY
; ---------------------------------------------------
; Requested: TP 2.5 / lots 0.02 / spacing_min 2.5 / ATRMult 1.0.  All four are
; set as requested. Three SUPPORTING values had to change or the test would
; measure a bug instead of the idea:
;
;  1. InpReanchorMult 1.0 -> 3.0
;     The re-anchor rule fires when SMA(20) drifts more than Mult x spacing.
;     At spacing 2.5p on M5 that is a 2.5-pip drift, which happens several
;     times an hour -- so the EA would cancel its own resting ladder before it
;     could fill. That is a milder rerun of the v1 bug that gave a 0.095% fill
;     rate. 3.0 x 2.5 = 7.5 pips gives the ladder room to work.
;
;  2. InpSpacingMaxPips 15.0 -> 6.0
;     With ATRMult 1.0 the ceiling is unreachable anyway; 6.0 keeps the
;     geometry honest and makes the pinning obvious in the log.
;
;  3. InpCooldownMins 1440 (absolute), NOT InpCooldownBars
;     96 bars is 24h on M15 but only 8h on M5. Leaving it in bars would hand
;     this preset a 3x shorter cooldown and make the comparison meaningless.
;
; MEASURED EXPECTATION (zero-edge synthetic, 12 seeds x 3y, same price path)
; ------------------------------------------------------------------------
;   conservative : 18.8 TP/wk, 2.45 stops/wk, 88.5% win, RATIO 0.34
;   aggressive   : 18.6 TP/wk, 4.43 stops/wk, 80.7% win, RATIO 0.23
;
; Note carefully: take-profits per week did NOT rise, while stop-outs nearly
; DOUBLED. Cost ratio goes 10% -> 20%. D_max falls 42p -> 15p, which is a
; routine EUR/USD half-hour rather than a tail event.
;
; Magic 770502 -- MUST differ from the conservative preset's 770501.
;
InpTPPips=2.5
InpLotsPerLevel=0.02
InpATRMult=1.0
InpSpacingMinPips=2.5
InpSpacingMaxPips=6.0
InpWiden=0.25
InpMaxLevels=3
InpPrePlaceLevels=2
InpReanchorMult=3.0
InpBasketMult=6.0
InpEquityStopPct=6.0
InpDisasterMult=2.0
InpCooldownBars=288
InpCooldownMins=1440
InpAnchorMA=20
InpATRPeriod=20
InpERWindow=20
InpERFull=0.35
InpERHalf=0.50
InpRSIPeriod=14
InpRSILongVeto=25.0
InpRSIShortVeto=75.0
InpBWExpansionMult=1.6
InpBWMedianBars=50
InpRolloverMins=5
InpFlatOnFriday=true
InpFridayCloseHour=20
InpMagic=770502
InpSlippagePoints=10
InpVerboseLog=true
InpCsvLog=true
InpCsvCommonFolder=false
